  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your essence rushes to the forefront to aid where it is needed.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may reallocate your essence as an immediate action in response to being targeted by an attack, making a saving throw, making an attack roll, or an ally under the effect of one of your veils being in any of these situations. You may use this ability after the result of the roll is revealed.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rajah#toc42\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
